# A triple-start screw thread made through its screen on an extruded
# circle, its starts level and fading out 4 mm before its end. The same
# model as path_thread_runout.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceThreadRunOut).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The designation, the level starts, the run-out, then make it.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit M20xPh3P1
twmove 640 130
twdown L 640 130
twup L 640 130
twmove 487 170
twdown L 487 170
twup L 487 170
edit 4
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
